Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71
Quest 764 "[Lemegeton] Devil 2 Archduke Agares"
    Journal "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Kill 1 of 9218, 9145

Requires player level >= 75 and player is elmorad and quest 762 is completed

Rewards
    Give 72500000 experience
    Give 100000 coins
    Give 100 np
    Give 2 of 900017000

On available
    Say "There's a rumor that there's the conclusion now. Go visit Bros to hear what's up."

On offer
    Show quest "We've been waiting for you. Now it's time to defeat the enemy.\n\nIt seems we've reached a critical turning point. Finally, the higher-ups have made a bold decision. They intend to strike directly at the leaders of the demons. This time, we're facing a particularly formidable foe?[Devil 2] Grand Duke Agares, who ranks second in the hierarchy. Not only does he command the Grand Duke's forces, but he also governs the eastern regions of Hell, commanding 31 legions under his control. The earthquakes he causes are powerful enough to bring about the end of the world.To confront him, you must obtain the [Devil 2 Summoning Scroll] and find the [Devil 2 Summoning Stone] here in [Ronark Land]. Not only demons but also warriors from enemy nations might target you for glory, <selfname>, so make sure you're fully prepared.\n\nYou have to receive [Devil 2 Summoning Scroll] from [Order of the sorcery] Seis, of Ronark Land. Then, summon [Devil 2] Agares from [Devil 2 Summoning Stone] at El Morad Castle area and kill him. \n※ [Devil 2 Summoning Scroll] is free the first time, but from the next time on you'll have to pay a million Noahs."

On in_progress
    Say "Still, the wrath of [Devil 2] Agares is engulfing this land. Please hurry."

On claimable
    Show quest "It seems you have successfully dealt with him, as his wrath has vanished. Well done.\n\nWith the sealing of [Devil 2] Agares, the defeat of the demons is now certain. Now, all that remains is to deal with the other demons. This time, you'll be facing [Devil 25] Glasya-Labolas and [Devil 49] Corcell, known as the generals of the massacre. Countless members of the [Order of the Sorcery] have fallen by their hands, and you must seal them to soothe their vengeful spirits."
